 "brief": "An Israeli court sentenced Palestinian prisoner Ata Ramilat to 42 months in prison and imposed a fine of 5,000 shekels, Shehab Wire reported.\n\nThe ruling came after proceedings in the Israeli military court system, which handles cases involving Palestinians from the occupied territories. Details regarding the specific charges against Ramilat and the circumstances that led to his prosecution were not disclosed in available court announcements.",
